  "changelog": "Dockerfile language server package 0.1.0\n\nMinimum Cadencr application version: 0.16.1. This release publishes package assets only. Production marketplace catalog admission, the LSP revocation feed and the desktop release remain separate rollout steps.\n\nCanonical archive and runtime qualification: https://github.com/merkr-software/CadencR/actions/runs/42215738947\n\nRequires an existing Node.js >= 20.0.0. Qualification used Node.js 22.19.0; upstream supported-major restrictions still apply. Cadencr does not install Node.js or resolve project dependencies.\n\n<!-- cadencr-publication-binding:sha256:d85674487be685608c4bcafbaa612d6e5340decbbf2993d052631b4fbbc5e970 -->"
